   Zhang, Liangsheng and Zhang, Xingtan and Chen, Fei and Jiao, Yuannian
   and Guo, Yalong and Hughes, Mark and Wang, Wei and Liu, Xiaofei and
   Zhong, Chunmei and Li, Airong and Sahu, Sunil Kumar and Yang, Huanming
   and Wu, Ernest and Sharbrough, Joel and Lisby, Michael and Liu, Xin and
