   women migrants living in European cities in relation to the practices of
   using their social media on digital platforms. It aims to understand the
   feelings, emotions and affections of being and being a connected migrant
   and their relationship with their family networks, friendships and with
   natives and other migrants. The method used was structured and
   semistructured interviews.},
